Facet (games/facet): credits and licences

Inspired by Splendor.

Code, rules text, the card set and all art: this repository (MIT, see LICENSE). The commissions and patrons are
generated and balanced by tools/gen-cards.mjs (src/cards_data.h, assets/cards.json); the card faces, backs and
patron tiles are painted by code in src/main.c, the table and pieces are built in code.

The stones' cuts (src/cuts.c, src/cuts.h) come from the jewels game in even-more-cartwheel-examples, by the same
author (MIT).

Font: Cinzel (assets/fonts/Cinzel.ttf), copyright 2020 The Cinzel Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1
(assets/fonts/Cinzel-OFL.txt).

Engine: cartwheel-engine (MIT), with its own third-party notices.
